{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "homelab-overview",
  "title": "Homelab Overview",
  "description": "Panel de aterrizaje: estado de la flota, acceso rapido al resto de dashboards por dominio, salud del propio stack de monitorizacion.",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "home"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fleet: VMs / Proxmox / NAS / Router",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "VMs k3s (node-exporter)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=~\".*node-exporter.*\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Proxmox / NAS / Router",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**No monitorizados todavia (sin exporter desplegado):**\n\n- Proxmox `zoro` (192.168.1.3) y `nami` (192.168.1.4) \u2014 hosts fisicos\n- NAS Synology `nas.bonchan.org` (192.168.1.1)\n- Router ASUS (192.168.0.1) y router site B (192.168.20.1)\n- Raspberry Pi `luffy` (Pi-hole / Home Assistant) y site B (PiVPN)\n\nVer `TODO.md`: *\"Mejoras de monitorizacion\"* / *\"Monitorizacion de la red\"*."
      }
    },
